#
# Cross-platform address space abstraction for kernel task and process
# management. Provides page protection flag combinators and a PMM-backed
# AddressSpace class with map/unmap/translate operations. On architectures
# without a native page table implementation, mapping operations succeed
# as software-only bookkeeping (no hardware TLB manipulation).
